    "applicability": "OR between applies_to rules, AND between fields within a rule; any value in each field matches",
    "status_semantics": "Statuses record planning readiness only; do not convert dependency records or product cases to passed. Actual availability is checked per run. Missing external prerequisites block only affected attempts.",
