    "retention": "Raw run evidence is copied from temporary output into access-controlled artifact storage with a stable run_id and hashes. Access/retention/deletion policy must be frozen in PRE-15; no numeric period or cloud upload is authorized here.",
    "baseline_updates": "Requirement/design change first, candidate/diff and independent review next, then explicit baseline approval. Never update expected results or screenshots merely to pass."
